---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: PureBakes Customer Reviews | Custom Cakes in Hyderabad
description: Read genuine PureBakes customer reviews and experiences for custom birthday, anniversary, wedding and celebration cakes in Hyderabad.
pageType: testimonials
pageSlug: testimonials
canonical: https://purebakes.in/testimonials/
breadcrumb:
  - label: Testimonials
---

<header class="page-hero wrap testimonials-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Customer Reviews</p>
  <h1>What Customers Say About PureBakes</h1>
  <p>
    Read experiences shared by customers who chose PureBakes for birthdays,
    anniversaries, weddings and other celebrations in Hyderabad.
  </p>
  <a
    class="button button--primary"
    href="https://search.google.com/local/reviews?placeid=ChIJw-5rzBOVyzsRNtLKQ1AaT1Q"
    data-track="google_reviews_click"
    >Read More Reviews</a
  >
</header>

<section
  class="section testimonials-collection"
  aria-labelledby="reviews-title"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">In their own words</p>
        <h2 id="reviews-title">Customer Experiences</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Hear from customers who shared their PureBakes experience on Google.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      {% for review in testimonials %}<article class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__head">
          <h3>{{ review.name }}</h3>
          {% if review.rating %}<span
            aria-label="{{ review.rating }} out of 5 stars"
            >★★★★★</span
          >{% endif %}
        </div>
        <p>{{ review.quote }}</p>
        <footer>
          <span>{{ review.source }}</span>{% if review.link %}<a
            class="text-link"
            href="{{ review.link }}"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-track="google_reviews_click"
            >View Original Review →</a
          >{% endif %}
        </footer>
      </article>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section testimonials-discovery">
  <div class="wrap compact-split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--gold">Designed around the occasion</p>
      <h2>Made for Meaningful Celebrations</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        Every custom cake starts with a different celebration, design idea and
        set of preferences. Customer experiences offer a useful look at how
        PureBakes approaches cakes for birthdays, anniversaries, weddings,
        engagements and other special occasions.
      </p>
      <div class="home-link-row">
        <a class="button button--gold" href="/cakes/">Explore Custom Cakes</a
        ><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">View Real Cake Gallery →</a
        ><button
          class="text-link"
          type="button"
          data-availability-open
          data-cta-location="testimonials_discovery"
        >
          Check Availability →
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
